     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><code><span style=\"color:#000\">I am trying to estimate what should be a very simple model for the mean and variance of the distribution of 6 correlated wealth measures </span><span style=\"color:#000\">by state and race, with partial pooling over states. The model, however, seems to run slower than it should, and the chain doesn&#39;t mix at all. I can&#39;t seem to find where I screwed up. <br><br>Also, is there any way to vectorize the calls to a multivariate dist?<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Nstate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>row_vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Wealth1984</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">State1984</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Race1984</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>parameters</span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> SD</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>corr_matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Rho</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">MuAlpha</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">SDAlpha</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>corr_matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">RhoAlpha</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Alpha</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Nstate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>model</span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> L</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> L_A</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br> SD </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cauchy</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">MuAlpha</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">MuAlpha</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> <br> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">SDAlpha</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cauchy</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">SDAlpha</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cauchy</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  L_A</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> diag_matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">SDAlpha</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">])*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cholesky_decompose</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">RhoAlpha</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  L_A</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> diag_matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">SDAlpha</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">])*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cholesky_decompose</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">RhoAlpha</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">s </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Nstate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Alpha</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">s</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> multi_normal_cholesky</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rep_vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> L_A</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Alpha</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">s</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> multi_normal_cholesky</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rep_vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> L_A</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            <br> L </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> diag_matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">SD</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cholesky_decompose</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Rho</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> <br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>   </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Wealth1984</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> multi_normal_cholesky</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">MuAlpha</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Race1984</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]]+</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Alpha</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#606\">State1984</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Race1984</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> L  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>             </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></div></code></div><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#000\"></span></code></div>"
